{"shortDescription":"Asia's diesel markets softened on Friday, with timespreads and refining margins surrendering most of the week's gains, while October spot sales stayed brisk.Market attention is on October refiner sales this week, with a handful of deals mostly done at premiums of $4 a barrel - gaining by around $3…","astDescription":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"p","children":["Asia's diesel markets softened on Friday, with timespreads and refining margins surrendering most of the week's gains, while October spot sales stayed brisk."]},{"type":"p","children":["Market attention is on October refiner sales this week, with a handful of deals mostly done at premiums of $4 a barrel - gaining by around $3 or more from last month - as buyers pay for their requirements."]},{"type":"p","children":["Concerns have emerged on China's exports for next month and refiners still have to apply for their planned volumes in the coming week."]},{"type":"p","children":["At least two Chinese refiners were offering October cargoes this week, with discussions also in single-digit premiums."]},{"type":"p","children":["The front-month east-west spread widened back to discounts of more than $150 a ton, reflecting softer performance in Asian markets in two sessions."]},{"type":"p","children":["Refining margins (GO10SGCKMc1) declined for two straight sessions to around $80.7 a barrel following a mid-week rally to record highs, with this level $3 lower week on week."]},{"type":"p","children":["Cash differentials (GO10-SIN-DIF) eased back to around $4.1 a barrel, a one week low, against a backdrop of continuously thin window spot activity."]},{"type":"p","children":["For jet fuel, discussion levels were little changed through the week, with some deals remaining at premiums of about $1 a barrel for October."]},{"type":"p","children":["Regrade (JETREG10SGMc1) narrowed slightly to discounts of nearly $4 a barrel."]},{"type":"p","children":["SINGAPORE CASH DEALS"]},{"type":"p","children":["- No deal for gasoil or jet fuel"]},{"type":"p","children":["INVENTORIES"]},{"type":"p","children":["- Jet fuel stocks independently held in the Amsterdam-Rotterdam-Antwerp (ARA) refining and storage hub rose 19.6% on the week, data from Dutch consultancy Insights Global showed on Thursday."]},{"type":"p","children":["REFINERY NEWS"]},{"type":"p","children":["- Exxon Mobil said floodwater overwhelmed a pump at its 275,000-barrel-per-day refinery in Joliet, Illinois, according to a filing on Thursday."]},{"type":"p","children":["NEWS"]},{"type":"p","children":["- Saudi Arabia has sold about 60 million barrels of crude from its Ras Tanura port inside the Strait of Hormuz for loading via ship-to-ship transfer at the Omani port of Sohar this month and next, trade sources said on Friday."]},{"type":"p","children":["- Three pumping stations serving the vital East-West Pipeline in Saudi Arabia were damaged in an attack last week — one more thanassessed previously — with a repair timeline unclear, three industry sources said."]},{"type":"p","children":["- China's exports of refined oil products in August rose 12.7% year-on-year amid the Iran war, with jet fuel exports hitting a record high, customs data showed on Friday."]},{"type":"p","children":["PRICES"]},{"type":"table","children":[{"type":"table-body","children":[{"type":"table-row","children":[{"type":"table-data-cell","children":[{"type":"p","children":["MIDDLE DISTILLATES"]}]},{"type":"table-data-cell","children":[]},{"type":"table-data-cell","children":[]},{"type":"table-data-cell","children":[]},{"type":"table-data-cell","children":[]}]},{"type":"table-row","children":[{"type":"table-data-cell","children":[{"type":"p","children":["CASH ($/BBL)"]}]},{"type":"table-data-cell","children":[{"type":"p","children":["ASIA CLOSE"]}]},{"type":"table-data-cell","children":[{"type":"p","children":["Change"]}]},{"type":"table-data-cell","children":[{"type":"p","children":["Prev Close"]}]},{"type":"table-data-cell","children":